<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n83064" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πί̆εσ-μα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, 
			Dor.
		 and later Gr. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πίασμα</span></b> , τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>anything pressed</i>: </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<i>pulpy mass left after pressing, pomace</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μυροβαλάνου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					10.911
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Gp.</u>
				20.28
			</span></i> : pl., of <i>cakes</i> of olive-pulp, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PSI</u>
				9.1030.11
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">ii A. D.</span>, in form <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πιάσματα</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>juice pressed out</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.78
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πίεσις, δακτύλου
				πιέσματι</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				Eub.
				75.11
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πιάσματι</span> codd.<i><span class="en">
				Ath.
			</span></i>), cf.<i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				12.41
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Mel.
			</span></i>).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
